WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:21.409
I planted red bell pepper seeds today.

2
00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:26.152
First, I put the seeds in a pot.

3
00:00:26.153 --> 00:00:32.848
Next, I covered them with soil.

4
00:00:32.849 --> 00:00:45.727
Then, I watered them.

5
00:00:45.728 --> 00:00:49.206
This morning I checked the pepper pot.

6
00:00:49.207 --> 00:00:53.365
I didn't see anything.

7
00:00:53.366 --> 00:01:04.866
Are roots growing in the soil?

8
00:01:04.867 --> 00:01:08.560
Today I saw a green sprout!

9
00:01:08.561 --> 00:01:18.122
A tiny stem is poking through the soil. Yay!

10
00:01:18.123 --> 00:01:23.704
The stem gets taller each day.

11
00:01:23.705 --> 00:01:26.184
Leaves are growing.

12
00:01:26.185 --> 00:01:44.608
My pepper seedling looks strong.

13
00:01:44.609 --> 00:01:51.731
This morning I planted the seedling in the backyard.

14
00:01:51.732 --> 00:02:15.952
The sunny backyard is good for the plant.

15
00:02:15.953 --> 00:02:18.678
Today I looked at my pepper plant.

16
00:02:18.679 --> 00:02:23.095
I saw many small buds on it.

17
00:02:23.096 --> 00:02:33.903
Flowers will grow from those buds.

18
00:02:33.904 --> 00:02:37.411
Now flowers are blooming on the plant!

19
00:02:37.412 --> 00:02:47.968
The tiny white flowers are so pretty.

20
00:02:47.969 --> 00:02:51.958
Hmm. The flowers died quickly.

21
00:02:51.959 --> 00:02:59.806
But the plant has tiny green peppers!

22
00:02:59.807 --> 00:03:02.790
The peppers are changing color.

23
00:03:02.791 --> 00:03:05.920
Some are still green.

24
00:03:05.921 --> 00:03:14.288
But some are turning red!

25
00:03:14.289 --> 00:03:17.599
All my peppers are red now.

26
00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:21.448
That means they're finally ripe.

27
00:03:21.449 --> 00:03:29.792
I pick one and take a bite.

28
00:03:29.793 --> 00:03:35.588
Yum!

